Subject: [PATCH] Skip the fullscreen editor on the primary cover

The donor opens the fullscreen extract editor when its cover is in landscape, which
suits the tall Fold5 cover. The near-square promoted cover is barely wider in
landscape, and the editor hides the whole app behind a text box and a Done button.
Never use it on the primary cover.

diff --git a/smali_classes3/com/samsung/android/honeyboard/service/HoneyBoardService.smali b/smali_classes3/com/samsung/android/honeyboard/service/HoneyBoardService.smali
--- a/smali_classes3/com/samsung/android/honeyboard/service/HoneyBoardService.smali
+++ b/smali_classes3/com/samsung/android/honeyboard/service/HoneyBoardService.smali
@@ -5310,7 +5310,32 @@
 
     move-result v0
 
-    if-eqz v0, :cond_3
+    if-eqz v0, :onigiri_cover_check
+
+    return v1
+
+    # Onigiri: the near-square promoted cover is barely wider in landscape, so the
+    # donor's fullscreen editor would only hide the app.
+    :onigiri_cover_check
+    invoke-virtual {p0}, Landroid/content/Context;->getDisplayId()I
+
+    move-result v0
+
+    if-nez v0, :cond_3
+
+    invoke-virtual {p0}, Landroid/content/Context;->getResources()Landroid/content/res/Resources;
+
+    move-result-object v0
+
+    invoke-virtual {v0}, Landroid/content/res/Resources;->getConfiguration()Landroid/content/res/Configuration;
+
+    move-result-object v0
+
+    iget v0, v0, Landroid/content/res/Configuration;->semDisplayDeviceType:I
+
+    const/4 v3, 0x5
+
+    if-ne v0, v3, :cond_3
 
     return v1
 
